{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334690/extras/1a94f0955a3f34dcb8c26445b9684a71.avif?t=1759848690\" width=616 height=354 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just another case to solve. It\u2019s a <strong>personal matter.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound as your guide</strong> \u2013 follow clues hidden in footsteps, creaking doors, and the melodies of an old radio.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphic compass</strong> \u2013 helps you navigate a world full of noise\u2026 and silence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sketchbook album</strong> \u2013 each scene is an illustration in the book of your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story and Achievements</strong> \u2013 there is only one ending. And only one <strong>True Detective Ultimate Achievement</strong>, which you earn by completing key achievements from all available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Noir atmosphere</strong> \u2013 original music and ambient sounds create tension. <strong><i>Headphones highly recommended.</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hear the footsteps? Don\u2019t wait \u2013 the case is waiting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2334690?t=1759848690","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334690/ba3aa9ef8697f9ba70bd4a8c096e06acac09a015/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759848690","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334690/c4d8088be6dd8762a994c9a5997363e491c1cbd5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759848690","capsule_i